// Probes for `runtime fn`s of a `Bytes(n)` (lib/native/runtime/bytes.hthr,
// docs/native/span-record-design.md): the function is compiled as the
// function of its bytes and `n` that its reflection writes out, and
// `f::runs_bytes` says the two agree at every record, with nothing proved
// by hand.
